{"fact_id": "A001", "original_fact_id": "F01", "text": "2000年8月16日，A驾驶的汽车越过双黄线，与另一辆车正面相撞。原文未提供碰撞重建或其他驾驶解释。", "origin": "anchor", "source_locators": ["CL-O2295730-P0005", "CL-O2295730-P0007"], "epistemic_status": "reported_event", "roles": [], "min_round": 0, "disclosure_gate": null, "doc_ids": []}
