{"fact_id": "A003", "original_fact_id": "F03", "text": "B在事故发生后不久到达，看见A眼睛很红、湿润、充血，据此认为A醉酒。A因受伤被送往医院，B未能在现场完成清醒度测试。B不是原文记载的碰撞目击者。", "origin": "anchor", "source_locators": ["CL-O2295730-P0010"], "epistemic_status": "suppression_hearing_testimony", "roles": ["R_OFFICER"], "min_round": 0, "disclosure_gate": null, "doc_ids": ["D02"]}
{"fact_id": "A004", "original_fact_id": "F04", "text": "在医院，B让A用视线跟随其来回移动的手指，进行眼震测试；原文记载A不能追踪手指，B据此认为其醉酒。没有原始眼震记录、资质资料或其他病因检验。", "origin": "anchor", "source_locators": ["CL-O2295730-P0011"], "epistemic_status": "suppression_hearing_testimony", "roles": ["R_OFFICER"], "min_round": 0, "disclosure_gate": null, "doc_ids": ["D02"]}
{"fact_id": "A005", "original_fact_id": "F05", "text": "B请求A接受PAS呼气筛查，并告知自愿性质及该测试不能代替被捕后的酒精含量测试义务。A同意该筛查。", "origin": "anchor", "source_locators": ["CL-O2295730-P0003", "CL-O2295730-P0011"], "epistemic_status": "reported_advisement_and_consent", "roles": ["R_OFFICER", "R_DEFENDANT"], "min_round": 0, "disclosure_gate": null, "doc_ids": ["D03"]}
